WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.240
Welcome to Timer App — a Cursor-branded countdown timer for focused work and presentations.

2
00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.067
Setup is a two-step flow.

3
00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:14.280
First, name your timer, set the duration, and optionally customize the final message.

4
00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:18.120
Start by naming the timer so the purpose is obvious on screen.

5
00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:23.520
Set hours, minutes, and seconds independently for any length of countdown.

6
00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:28.944
Customize the celebration message shown when time runs out, or keep the default Time's Up.

7
00:00:28.944 --> 00:00:37.584
On the next step, pick a clock animation — Default, Flip, Slide, or Fade — preview it live, then start the countdown.

8
00:00:37.584 --> 00:00:43.512
The live countdown shows your chosen animation, a progress bar, and the expected end time.

9
00:00:43.512 --> 00:00:45.371
Pause and resume anytime.

10
00:00:45.371 --> 00:00:48.792
Cancel returns you to setup when plans change.

11
00:00:48.792 --> 00:00:55.608
Enter fullscreen for presentations or shared screens — the countdown stays readable from across the room.

12
00:00:55.608 --> 00:01:01.008
Timer progress is saved in the browser, so a refresh keeps you on the same countdown.

13
00:01:01.008 --> 00:01:08.736
When the clock hits zero, confetti celebrates the finish and a summary shows start, end, and total duration.

14
00:01:08.736 --> 00:01:13.800
From the summary, start a new countdown and run the flow again whenever you need it.
